<title>USA: Duff rates U S West unit Triple B Plus.</title>
<headline>Duff rates U S West unit Triple B Plus.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Wednesday it assigned a Triple B Plus rating to U S West Capital Funding Inc's proposed $3.5 billion offering of notes and debentures.</p>
<p>The unsecured debt securities are expected to be offered in five tranches with five-, 10-, 30-, 40- and 100-year maturities. The 40-year debentures are expected to have a put option in the seventh year.</p>
<p>U S West Capital Funding is a unit of U S West Inc, a telecommunications provider.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
